  <div class="story-copy"><p>I founded Upstack Studio in 2017. My team and I spent years building web and mobile software with business owners.</p><p>The work taught me to look past the feature list. What will customers use? What deserves the budget? What is the team actually trying to change?</p><p>Eventually, I had to ask the same kind of question about my own business. Was this still the model I wanted to build?</p><p class="story-turn">The answer was no. I shut the agency down and chose a different path.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Read my story{{ icon("arrow", "link-arrow") }}</a></div>
